Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.39,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur2\fad(250,250)}回憶的寶庫裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:21.26,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur2\fad(250,250)}陳舊之物總放在架子深處
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:24.60,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}明明蒙上了厚厚塵埃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.72,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}但那份驕傲看起來仍熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:28.96,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.15,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}陪在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:32.19,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}不安 喝彩 齊心協力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:34.75,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}處於界限模糊的安全地帶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:36.56,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}清晨的那種倦怠感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.51,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}惹人頭暈目眩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:41.46,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}三號站台 准快車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:44.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}恍若青春般酸澀的春日與紫丁香
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:47.87,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}都在這裡等待你的到來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:51.42,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}以人生單位引發痛楚的傷痕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.52,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}我也想將其一併珍愛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:56.58,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}明明在漫無目的地找尋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:02:00.24,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}但我們還是遺忘了初心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:03.29,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}在有所經歷有所收穫後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:06.29,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.3\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\fad(200,200)}我們便會就此慢慢地長大成人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:09.55,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0\blur0\fad(200,200)}恍若落雨過去後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:13.07,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0\blur0\fad(200,200)}定會綠意盎然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.13,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0\blur0\fad(200,200)}堅信世間的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:19.62,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0\blur0\fad(200,200)}皆有意義 就此前進
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:19.31,ed jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\blur2}やぁ、望んだ砂は掴めたかい？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:27.11,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥かな距離より、かなめは行き方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.11,0:22:34.30,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}だあー！狙って外しちゃった、みたいな未来だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:38.88,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「ごめんな」忘レナ唄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:45.78,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}かけがえのない白い星より
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:51.78,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}追いかけがいのある夢であるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:17.29,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讃えながら握る泥の花
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:22.77,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}追いかけすぎたぜ、夢のあとで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:29.37,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}かけがえのない気がしてるよりも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:37.33,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}追いかけがいのある今であるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:19.31,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呀 你可曾緊握了心之所向的沙粒？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:27.11,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比起遙遠的距離 重要的是應該如何前行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.11,0:22:34.30,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像是已經瞄準了目標 卻失之交臂的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:38.88,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}“抱歉啊”這是不能忘卻的歌謠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:45.78,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比起不可替代的白色星星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:51.78,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我更希望擁有能不懈追逐的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:17.29,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給予讚賞的同時緊握泥中花
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:22.77,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太過執著於不斷追逐 夢境過後
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:29.37,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}與其總是覺得當下的一切不可替代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:37.33,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我更希望在追逐之中感受它的可貴
